[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="ArmouryLedger" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(500, -45)
script = ExtResource("2_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the armoury ledger"
flag_to_set = "ashguard_ledger_read"
discovery_text = "[b]The armoury ledger[/b]

The quartermaster's ledger is chained to its desk. Five years back, the week after the border war, one entry is in the commander's own hand: 'Four wagons of crown arms: one hundred and sixty swords, two hundred and forty spearheads, forty-eight crossbows with bolts. All lost with the deserter Sgt. Varn.'

But the stable log on the facing page counts the wagon-teams out of Ashguard that month, and only one team went with Varn. Three wagons left days earlier, signed out to a Guild factor. Varn's name was the easiest place to lose them."
reexamine_text = "Four wagons blamed on one deserter. Three of them signed out to the Guild days before he ran."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="StoryItems/ArmouryLedger"]
