[node name="WarrantBoard" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-200, 420)
script = ExtResource("2_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the warrant"
flag_to_set = "varn_warrant_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]A crown warrant[/b]

Nailed up, torn by weather, nailed up again:

VARN, late Sergeant of Ashguard. Deserter, and thief of crown arms. To be taken ALIVE and brought before the Commander of this fort. - L. Ferrow

Beneath, in a clerk's smaller hand: 'Or, should he resist, his death to answer this warrant in full.'

The word 'alive' has been underlined twice, in fresher ink."
reexamine_text = "VARN. To be taken ALIVE, underlined twice. And beneath it, smaller: or dead, should he resist."

