[node name="GarrisonRoll" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-500, -45)
script = ExtResource("2_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the garrison roll"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The garrison roll[/b]

Two hundred places on the roll and ninety-one names. Beside the struck-through ones, a clerk has written 'deserted', 'unpaid', 'sent home', and once, 'hanged'. The pay column has been empty for four months.

Ashguard guards the March with half a garrison and no silver."
reexamine_text = "Ninety-one names. Four months unpaid."

